#: includes/admin/class-settings.php:789
msgid "Link Rules"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-settings.php:791
msgid "Give links that match a URL pattern their own warning. Rules are checked from top to bottom and the first match wins. Links that match no rule use the settings on the other tabs. <code>*</code> matches any characters. A pattern without a slash matches the whole domain, for example <code>example.com</code> or <code>*.example.com</code> for its subdomains. A pattern with a slash matches the address, for example <code>amazon.com/dp/*</code>, and a pattern starting with a slash matches links on this site, for example <code>/go/*</code>. The Suppress Icon class still hides the icon, and the Affiliate and Force External classes override an Exclude rule."
msgstr ""

